Integration notes
- The narrow placed-copy RT ordering/forwarding port is already in this repository
  (6693300e4d); it remains opt-in.
- RTX 50 frame generation is not applicable to the RTX 3060.
- DualSense HID support is an input feature, not a rendering/performance change;
  its Windows-specific implementation was not ported or validated here.
- The fxceless ray-tracing builder change spans memory tracking and shader paths;
  it is not a safe piecemeal port, and the current NVIDIA play set keeps that
  ray-tracing builder path disabled.
